# Frontend artwork derived from a legitimate local game installation remains
# private/BYO together with the proprietary game data.

# Public, reproducible preparation/build helpers (the repository has a broad
# ports/*/tools ignore for private bring-up artifacts).
!tools/
!tools/*.sh
!tools/*.py

# Canonical public release artifacts built by this repository.
!huntdown/
!huntdown-nextos
!huntdown/huntdown-nextos
!libvulkan.so.1
!video-compat/libvulkan.so.1
!huntdown/video-compat/libvulkan.so.1
!nxextract/nxextract-ui
